{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"1dWQPX_vsd68tXkHoVI9x0k34xQdo5vnN","timestamp":1775762045787}],"mount_file_id":"14sdrqX4K5KRy9xLeg2eCpWXhoREDiai2","authorship_tag":"ABX9TyOvgoAgLJA8h/jxdjQII6sQ"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# **Forecasting: VIX Index Historical Data (2015-2025)**\n","\n","Este dataset contiene el registro histórico del índice VIX (Volatility Index), también conocido como el “índice del miedo”. A diferencia de otros indicadores, el VIX mide la expectativa de volatilidad del mercado a corto plazo, específicamente a 30 días.\n","\n","Los datos abarcan de enero de 2015 a diciembre de 2025, incluyendo distintos escenarios como etapas de estabilidad, crisis y recuperación. Por esto, es un conjunto de datos muy útil para analizar el riesgo, detectar cambios bruscos en el mercado y entender mejor el nivel de incertidumbre en el entorno financiero."],"metadata":{"id":"tTh6lLFR8bDd"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Manipulación y tratamiento de datos\n","import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# Gráficos\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","\n","#Modelos Estadísticos y Clásicos\n","from statsmodels.tsa.arima.model import ARIMA\n","from prophet import Prophet # Nos ayudará a detectar estacionalidades en el mercado.\n","\n","#Métricas de evaluación (para medir qué tan bueno es el modelo)\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, mean_absolute_error\n","\n","#Preprocesamiento y Deep Learning\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import MinMaxScaler\n","# Tensorflow y Keras son plataformas que utilizaremos para construir los modelos Deep Leraning (LSTM y Transformers)\n","import tensorflow as tf\n","from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\n","from tensorflow.keras.layers import Dense, LSTM, Dropout\n","from tensorflow.keras import layers, models\n","\n","\n","# Configuraciones usadas para que las gráficas se vean de alta calidad\n","%matplotlib inline\n","plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 6)\n","sns.set_style('whitegrid')"],"metadata":{"id":"Ga0wyh0_8loL"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**OBTENCIÓN DEL DATA SET: VIX – Volatility Index**"],"metadata":{"id":"OVAdmo5MyIPL"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["\n","#Cargar dataset en el cual definimos la fecha como índice y formato de  tiempo\n","df = pd.read_csv('/content/drive/MyDrive/2026_Arianna_y_Barbara/Datasets /Financiero/vix_historical_daily_2015_2025.csv', parse_dates=['Date'], index_col='Date')\n","print(\"Dataset cargado exitosamente. Primeras filas:\")\n","df.head()\n","\n","#Limpieza de datos\n","df.columns = df.columns.str.strip()\n","df.dropna(inplace=True)\n","df = df.sort_index()\n","\n","#VIX es una serie diaria, nos aseguramos que no falten días hábiles (LUNES VIENERS)\n","df = df.asfreq('B')\n","df.fillna(method='ffill', inplace=True) #Si falta un día, toma el valor del anterior\n","\n","\n","df.head()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":313},"id":"99rDKVyvsRk4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1775763902922,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":439,"user":{"displayName":"ARIANNA MONSERRATT HURTADO RAMOS","userId":"12283955907500007694"}},"outputId":"aa99faa2-11fa-438f-f6af-696b53e417fe"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Dataset cargado exitosamente. Primeras filas:\n"]},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stderr","text":["/tmp/ipykernel_25907/3519027858.py:13: FutureWarning: DataFrame.fillna with 'method' is deprecated and will raise in a future version. Use obj.ffill() or obj.bfill() instead.\n","  df.fillna(method='ffill', inplace=True) #Si falta un día, toma el valor del anterior\n"]},{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["                 Open       High        Low      Close  Adj Close  Volume\n","Date              